%% 实现真源: crates/helix-im/src/port_reply.rs；crates/helix-im/src/send/flow.rs；packages/message/src/lib/services/messageSend.service.ts
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular MessageSendService
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate
  participant Host as Native Host
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Java as Java 签名服务
  participant OSS as 对象存储
  participant Sink as EventSink
  UI->>Host: 本地附件暂存为账号绑定 opaque handle
  alt 暂存失败
    Host-->>UI: 错误
    Note over UI,Gate: 在 sendMsg 前中断，不提交发送命令
  else 暂存成功
    Host-->>UI: mediaHandle
    UI->>Gate: sendMsg(intent)
    Gate->>Host: im_send_message
    Host->>IM: 解析 handle 为 mediaInput 后 Tick::Command
    IM->>DB: PersistAtomic optimistic message 与 pending_media
    DB-->>IM: matching PersistOk
    IM->>Java: 经 Host HTTP prepare /oss/getPresignedUrl
    Java-->>IM: 经 PortReply 返回 prepare 成功或失败
    opt prepare 成功且阶段持久化成功
      IM->>OSS: 经 Host Effect::UploadFile PUT
      OSS-->>IM: 经 PortReply 返回上传成功或失败
    end
    alt prepare、PUT 或完成持久化失败
      IM->>IM: 标记失败及可重试阶段，禁止 posts/create
      IM->>DB: 持久化失败事实与恢复信息
      DB-->>IM: matching PersistOk
      IM->>Sink: 失败状态投影
      Sink-->>UI: 渲染本端失败态
    else 全部附件完成且本地 Complete 提交成功
      Note over IM,Host: 进入 G01c/G01d 发送链路
    end
  end
  Note over UI,Sink: 旧合同 helixCommand=NONE 是历史登记；当前失败分支由 im_send_message 内核生命周期承载
  Note over IM,DB: 存储失败不得伪造持久成功；远端未发 posts/create 时不产生接收者新消息
